  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">AGD Pacific Legal Policy Champions Program and Pacific Legal Policy Twinning Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In February 2025 an AGS lawyer delivered 1.5 days of pro bono training on presentation skills to 13 Pacific law and justice officials and police officers from 8 countries participating in the Attorney-General Department&apos;s Pacific Legal Policy Champions Program and the Pacific Legal Policy Twinning Program. This investment relates to AGS&apos;s delivery of training only, rather than the broader funding of these programs.</narrative>
  </description>
